# Aim: Take temperature in Celsius as input, convert it to Fahrenheit using the formula F = (C * 9/5) + 32.

# Take Celsius input from the user
celsius = float(input("Enter temperature in Celsius: "))

# Compute Fahrenheit value using the given formula
fahrenheit = (celsius * 9 / 5) + 32

# Print the result
print(f"Temperature in Celsius: {celsius}°C")
print(f"Temperature in Fahrenheit: {fahrenheit}°F")